			border-radius: 8px;
			object-fit: cover;
			border: 1px solid #d0dbd2;
			margin-right: 18px;
			background: #e2e8e4;
		}

		.ppc-card__details {
			flex: 1;
			min-width: 0;
		}

		.ppc-card__name {
